<title>USA: CSX Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>CSX Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.70		    $0.69</p>
<p> Net		 151,000		  146,000</p>
<p> Oper rev	  2,567,000		2,514,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  217,227		  210,964</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: During the quarter ended March 28, 1997, the company incurred net costs before income taxes of $24 million with respect to its investment in Conrail Inc common stock.  These net costs, principally interest on debt issued to acquire the investment less dividends received on the stock, reduced net earnings by $16 million, 7 cents per share.</p>
</text>
